# comic-hub has its own .gitignore for Node and Next.js output

### IDEs ###
# IntelliJ settings stay local; .vscode/settings.json is shared (it points at the Eclipse formatter)
/.idea
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
out/

### OS ###
.DS_Store

### Java ###
*.class
*.log
*.ctxt
.mtj.tmp/
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar
# JVM crash logs
hs_err_pid*

### Gradle ###
.gradle
**/build/
gradle-app.setting
.gradletasknamecache
# The wrapper jar is committed
!gradle-wrapper.jar

## Saved Docker Images
*.docker

### Project specific ###
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# Backup files
**/*.bak
**/backup/

# Runtime and temporary files
**/test-cache/
# The default comics.cache.location is C:/comics, which bootRun on Linux creates as a relative "C:" directory
**/C:/**
**/batch-integration-cache/**
**/integration-cache/**/
